WEBVTT

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:06.480
What are you doing, Boss?

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:08.020
Oh, Hy-chan!

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:15.240
<b>Craft Pub <b>Maou.</b></b>

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:11.590
I was thinking I could 
raise some vegetables here.

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:13.300
Home grown, you know?

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.240
Home grown?

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:19.430
I was thinking it would be nice to grow
my own veggies to serve in the restaurant.

00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:22.780
It would save money on ingredients, too.

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:25.400
What do you think?

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.380
Meh, seems like a huge pain in the butt.

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:32.400
Oh, but freshly picked 
vegetables are so tasty.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:35.620
You've got your radishes, lollo rosso,

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:39.870
bell peppers, cherry tomatoes, 
eggplants, okra...

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:45.190
<i>I just had a great idea.</i>

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:47.720
<i>If this little guy gets to growing...</i>

00:00:58.030 --> 00:01:00.740
I can save on my food bill!

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:20.300
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:21.450
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:22.640
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:23.830
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:25.000
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.230
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:45.510
<b>Restoration Plan No. 11

00:02:40.730 --> 00:02:43.850
I hope you come out soon, 
little cherry tomatoes.

00:02:44.190 --> 00:02:46.810
And then you'll have to grow nice and strong.

00:02:47.030 --> 00:02:48.900
I know you can do it.

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:51.770
What are you doing?

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:54.180
Taking care of my cherry tomatoes.

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:59.490
It said that if you talk to 
your plants, they grow better.

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:04.060
So I try to talk to them every day 
when I water them.

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:10.710
Still haven't sprouted, I see.

00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:12.650
You've got guts...

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:14.670
to be so insolent!

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:17.420
Take this!

00:03:18.390 --> 00:03:21.980
Now grow! Grow and fill my belly!

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:29.060
Look, look, Hy-chan!

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:30.960
They sprouted.

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:32.480
Cute, huh?

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:38.690
Keep it up, just like this!

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:42.780
And I'll keep showering you with love, too.

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:48.590
Why?

00:03:48.590 --> 00:03:50.910
Why won't you grow?!

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:53.750
Here I am, talking to you 
every day, giving you water,

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:56.380
and putting you in a nice sunny spot, 
yet this is how you repay me!

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:59.590
<i>I'll keep showering you with love.</i>

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:04.210
Are you telling me you don't get enough love?

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:11.780
Fine then, tomatoes... 
No! Starting today, your name is Tomarou!

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:13.270
<b>Name: Tomarou</b>

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:18.000
Tomarou, you exist to fill my belly.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:21.060
You live for me, and you shall die for me.

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:23.470
Consider it an honor! You got that?!

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:27.320
And if you still won't sprout...

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:33.000
I'll take you outside and into the sunshine!

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:35.810
Well, how's the outdoors? Nice and warm, huh?

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:38.030
You want to go home?

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:41.170
Well, too bad! Suck it up!

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:43.220
Ja-ko?

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:49.540
You're gonna get all 
the sunshine you can stand!

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:53.180
And after this, it's the
 elephant watering can for you!

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:55.390
What the hell is she doing?

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:04.360
Yes!

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:05.780
You sprouted!

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:09.120
I knew you could do it, Tomarou!

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:14.440
Hey, I know! As a reward,
 you get some expensive fertilizer.

00:05:14.440 --> 00:05:15.500
Rejoice!

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:18.070
Now you keep at it.

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:22.670
And when you grow me some produce, 
I'll make you my left-hand man!

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:30.860
Toma...rou?

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:33.890
Why, Tomarou?!

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:37.280
Are these bugs?!

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:39.650
<b>King of Gardening</b>

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:41.220
What a silly fool!

00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:43.860
You can't even take care of yourself 
when you're in danger!

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:46.790
You'll never become my underling this way!

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:49.910
<b>Bug Repellent
For Vegetables & Flowers
Made With Natural Herbs</b>

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:49.910
Here we go!

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:54.870
Bug repellent from natural herbs 
that's gentle on plants!

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:59.800
You can't die now!

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:02.540
Don't think you can croak before 
you bear fruit, Tomarou!

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:05.200
Hang in there, Tomarou!

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:06.410
Live!

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:08.510
Believe it in your heart!

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:11.470
I know you can do it! I <i>know</i> it!

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:13.140
Tomarou!

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:15.800
Tomarou...

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:25.070
Tomarou!

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:26.150
Toma...

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:31.820
Tomarou!

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:34.280
You did it!

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:36.040
What a feat!

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:40.690
I knew you'd become my left-hand man.

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:53.240
Tomarou...

00:07:05.050 --> 00:07:07.290
<i>Thus the days passed...</i>

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:21.480
Produce!

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:24.810
We've got produce!

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:29.570
All right!

00:07:29.570 --> 00:07:32.300
You did it! You really did it, Tomarou!

00:07:32.730 --> 00:07:35.480
I always believed in you.

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:38.520
I believed in you! I knew you'd serve me!

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:41.180
So beautiful.

00:07:41.180 --> 00:07:44.160
Almost too beautiful to eat.

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:46.800
But I'm gonna eat it anyway!

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:56.240
That's hot!

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:58.990
Hot, hot, hot, hot, hot, hot, hot, hot!

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:05.100
Blech, that's terrible... just terrible...

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:08.880
You betrayed me!

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:10.630
Why?!

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:11.720
You're supposed to be a tomato!

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:13.380
A tomato!

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:16.080
A little tiny tomato!

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:16.930
<b>The My Little Vegetable Garden Series</b>

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:16.930
<b>Habanero</b>

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:16.930
<b>That famous super-hot chili!
Also a great ornamental plant
 for its beautiful red color</b>

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:16.930
<b>30 seeds</b>

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:22.430
Give me back my time and my money 
and my love and my hard work!

00:08:23.470 --> 00:08:25.770
Thank you again for all the wonderful produce.

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:31.670
How sweet!

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:44.330
The window...

00:08:44.550 --> 00:08:45.540
Damnation.

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:48.080
This is why this place is a dump.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:50.710
Fixed it.

00:08:50.890 --> 00:08:54.780
I can't wait to get 
the hell out of this hovel.

00:08:56.880 --> 00:08:57.890
Landlord?

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:00.640
What do you want?

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:02.560
Rent isn't due yet!

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:06.810
I'm living here now.

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:12.230
What?

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:14.700
I got in a fight with my sister.

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:16.660
What?!

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:19.350
Don't get me mixed up 
in your sibling rivalry!

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:20.690
What do you care?

00:09:20.690 --> 00:09:22.870
Shoo, shoo! Git! Scram! Go home!

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:26.830
I'm the one who lets you live here in 
the first place, so stop complaining.

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:31.100
<i>Why </i>my<i> apartment though?</i>

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:33.050
<i>Wait...</i>

00:09:33.290 --> 00:09:35.060
The next unit is empty.

00:09:35.060 --> 00:09:36.980
Why don't you go live there alone?

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:43.850
I'd be lonely all by myself!

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:45.180
What?!

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:46.410
Then go back home!

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:48.060
I told you I'm not doin' that!

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:52.020
What about the inconvenience
 you're causing me?!

00:09:57.930 --> 00:09:59.880
Your rent will be free.

00:10:02.150 --> 00:10:04.410
Please make yourself at home!

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:06.470
Then it's all settled!

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:08.760
I only have bedding and food for myself.

00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:11.060
I know. I don't need food.

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:12.080
I'll take the bedding, though.

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:14.420
Say what?! Everything is for me!

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:16.510
Then I guess we're sleepin' together!

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:18.260
Hell no, you moron!

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:20.090
You can sleep on the floor!

00:10:26.910 --> 00:10:28.980
That's <i>my</i> blanket!

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:33.690
Now I can finally sleep...

00:10:39.050 --> 00:10:40.930
That's mine!

00:10:41.940 --> 00:10:43.100
You...

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:49.060
Get out!

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:54.960
Go home and make up with the boss already!

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:57.510
Not until she comes over and apologizes.

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:59.510
What about <i>me</i>?!

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:01.800
You ate my snacks without asking!

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:03.720
You leave your clothes all over!

00:11:03.900 --> 00:11:05.830
You even steal my blanket!

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:08.480
I... I...

00:11:08.740 --> 00:11:11.480
Get out, get out, get out, get out!

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:13.700
Fine.

00:11:14.390 --> 00:11:16.580
On top of the free rent,

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:19.600
I'll take care of the housework.

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:20.400
How's that?

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:23.800
Stay as long as you like!

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:25.370
Heck yeah!

00:11:26.010 --> 00:11:27.840
I'm going out for a bit.

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:29.330
Where to?

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:31.080
I'm meeting someone.

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:33.770
Make sure to do the housework while I'm gone.

00:11:33.770 --> 00:11:35.380
Right.

00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:41.720
<i>I freaking hate you, Sis!</i>

00:11:41.900 --> 00:11:43.130
<i>Ryou-chan!</i>

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:44.930
<i>I'm getting out of here!</i>

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:46.990
<i>And I'm never coming back!</i>

00:11:51.950 --> 00:11:52.820
Shit!

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:55.770
Damn it.

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:59.230
Why do I have to take 
care of my damn landlord?

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:01.750
O Great Jahy!

00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:06.660
Druj!

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:09.640
I was just on my way!

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:11.370
Please get in!

00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:14.430
Sure...

00:12:26.940 --> 00:12:29.930
Well then, shall we begin?

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:36.860
Our meeting regarding our mana 
crystal collection progress?

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:42.820
<i>O-Oh no, the time has finally come...</i>

00:12:42.970 --> 00:12:44.600
I'll go first.

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:48.030
<b>Badump   Badump</b>

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:49.640
The small pieces I had my employees 
collect comes to thirty shards.

00:12:50.690 --> 00:12:53.210
<i>Th-Thirty?!</i>

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:55.530
There haven't been many big shards.

00:12:56.180 --> 00:12:57.420
Only six.

00:12:57.420 --> 00:12:59.880
<i>Six big ones?!</i>

00:13:00.140 --> 00:13:04.010
I believe we're about to exhaust 
this particular area.

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:07.940
We still don't know how far the 
mana crystals were scattered.

00:13:07.940 --> 00:13:11.610
I believe that we should not only 
expand our search range,

00:13:11.610 --> 00:13:13.750
but also conduct further investigation.

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:18.510
That's all for my part.

00:13:19.280 --> 00:13:21.940
Y-You did really we—

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:27.360
I am deeply sorry for not being 
able to bring you good news!

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:33.870
I completely understand why you
would be dismayed by these results!

00:13:34.070 --> 00:13:37.000
How could I have fallen this short?!

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:40.380
I am... a worm!

00:13:40.940 --> 00:13:43.310
No! Less than a worm!

00:13:45.410 --> 00:13:47.400
<i>If that makes her less than a worm...</i>

00:13:47.400 --> 00:13:51.070
<i>Then what about me, who lost
mana crystals instead of gaining any?</i>

00:13:51.780 --> 00:13:53.990
<i>Ja-heek!</i>

00:13:54.010 --> 00:13:54.930
Your Greatness!

00:13:56.340 --> 00:13:59.120
I beg you! Please reprimand me!

00:13:59.590 --> 00:14:00.190
But...

00:14:00.510 --> 00:14:02.140
There is no need for mercy!

00:14:02.630 --> 00:14:05.400
I must be made an example of!

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:08.320
Please... Please!

00:14:08.980 --> 00:14:10.660
Well, if you insist...

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:13.950
<i>She leaves me with no choice.</i>

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:18.060
You're garbage.

00:14:19.950 --> 00:14:22.590
No, worse than that.

00:14:25.450 --> 00:14:29.820
You'd <i>dare</i> report this to me?

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:31.690
Idiot!

00:14:31.690 --> 00:14:33.350
You absolute moron!

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:41.720
Another fresh juice.

00:14:41.720 --> 00:14:42.920
And that's not all.

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:44.980
I'll take one of your seasonal parfaits.

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:46.440
Coming right up.

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:50.360
Of course... you'll be paying, Druj!

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:54.120
And on top of that...

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:55.540
Whatever you'd like.

00:14:56.030 --> 00:14:59.040
The special pudding à la mode set...

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:00.960
for one!

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:07.420
Thank you for the scolding!

00:15:08.110 --> 00:15:09.090
Sure.

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:12.800
<i>I'm the one who's worse than garbage.</i>

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:16.140
Next, we can hear your report.

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:17.520
<i>This is bad!</i>

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:22.030
<i>I can't tell her now that 
my mana crystal was stolen!</i>

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:25.320
<i>I need to change the subject!</i>

00:15:27.720 --> 00:15:30.800
I've located the magical girl 
who destroyed our world.

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:34.340
Truly, O Great Jahy?!

00:15:34.340 --> 00:15:36.270
<i>Good. She took the bait.</i>

00:15:36.270 --> 00:15:37.520
I see.

00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:39.580
I can't believe she was nearby.

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:40.840
How vexing!

00:15:40.840 --> 00:15:42.530
Where is she this very moment?

00:15:42.530 --> 00:15:44.040
I'll go defeat her now!

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:45.680
Calm down, Druj.

00:15:46.260 --> 00:15:50.540
<i>That's the ticket! 
I can feed her info on the magical girl.</i>

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:52.880
<i>If I have Druj defeat the magical girl,</i>

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:57.500
<i>I can concentrate on collecting 
mana crystals without fear.</i>

00:15:58.120 --> 00:15:59.980
You see, the magical girl is...

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:01.500
I understand!

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:03.640
The Dark Realm...

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:07.090
You've finally avenged it for all demonkind!

00:16:07.090 --> 00:16:09.140
You have my sincerest apologies.

00:16:09.640 --> 00:16:15.950
It's only obvious that you wouldn't
let her live after discovering her.

00:16:16.260 --> 00:16:21.660
How presumptuous of me to say 
that I'd go defeat her posthaste!

00:16:17.900 --> 00:16:21.000
Wait... Er...

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:26.170
I bet you took out that
 magical girl in an instant!

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:28.750
<i>Not only was it </i>not<i> an instant kill...</i>

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:30.710
<i>I had my mana crystal taken.</i>

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:32.510
<i>I got drunk.</i>

00:16:33.100 --> 00:16:34.880
<i>I let humans cheer me up.</i>

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:37.070
<i>I... I...</i>

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:41.200
I took her out. Yup. That was me.

00:16:41.800 --> 00:16:43.560
No big deal.

00:16:43.720 --> 00:16:47.000
Then this means there's no one left in the 
way of restoring the Dark Realm!

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:48.610
R-Right.

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:53.190
Off topic, but what's been going on outside?

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:06.080
That's such a flashy outfit.

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:08.400
And was that a mana stone?

00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:09.700
Could that have been...

00:17:09.700 --> 00:17:12.020
Your Greatness, do you know her?

00:17:12.930 --> 00:17:15.200
Sh-She's a, well...

00:17:15.740 --> 00:17:20.390
<i>If I tell her that's the magical girl, 
my cover story will be blown!</i>

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:23.310
She's my new underling!

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:24.920
What?!

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:28.660
I mean, she's human, sure,
but she's quite strong,

00:17:28.660 --> 00:17:32.830
and she's really quite handy 
for collecting mana crystals.

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:37.040
So lately I've been making 
her gather them up for me.

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:39.120
A <i>human</i>?

00:17:39.310 --> 00:17:43.900
She is, but she insisted.
 She just <i>begged</i> to work for me.

00:17:43.900 --> 00:17:45.780
There were others, too, but...

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:51.460
<b>P</b>

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:51.460
<b>O</b>

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:51.460
<b>U</b>

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:51.460
<b>T</b>

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:56.360
She's just a human, but you can 
depend on her more than me?

00:17:56.360 --> 00:17:58.130
Oh, I wouldn't say that...

00:17:58.130 --> 00:17:59.890
I won't stand for this!

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:00.930
Druj...

00:18:01.170 --> 00:18:05.350
I'm going to collect more mana crystals 
than her and prove I'm superior in every way!

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:09.150
That I alone am your 
most valuable underling!

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:10.940
S-Sure...

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:13.880
Please look forward to our next meeting!

00:18:21.520 --> 00:18:24.080
<i>I managed to bullshit my way out of that one!</i>

00:18:24.310 --> 00:18:26.760
<i>Dignity intact!</i>

00:18:26.130 --> 00:18:27.940
I'll leave your check here.

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:30.000
<i>I even got the check.</i>

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:32.200
<i>Wait, the check?!</i>

00:18:32.990 --> 00:18:33.920
Druj?

00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:37.110
Druj!

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:40.550
<i>The Great Jahy kept her pride,
but it came at a great cost...</i>

00:18:44.280 --> 00:18:46.390
I'm back, Land...lord...

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:49.920
Welcome back.

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:54.470
You didn't do any of the housework!

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:56.360
That's not true. Look.

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:58.100
I folded the laundry.

00:18:58.100 --> 00:18:59.570
It's a complete mess!

00:18:59.780 --> 00:19:01.330
I fixed food, too.

00:19:01.330 --> 00:19:03.200
That's just instant ramen!

00:19:03.470 --> 00:19:05.920
The vacuum just, like, broke or something.

00:19:05.920 --> 00:19:07.160
You killed it!

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:08.260
You!

00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:10.000
You have no idea 
how to do housework, do you?!

00:19:10.220 --> 00:19:11.660
Oh, put a sock in it.

00:19:11.660 --> 00:19:14.110
I don't normally do it, 
so how the hell <i>should</i> I know?

00:19:14.110 --> 00:19:16.250
Don't offer to do it if you don't know how!

00:19:16.780 --> 00:19:18.210
Go home already!

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:18.210
<b>Sis</b>

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:23.180
Hey, pick that up!

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:24.180
I won't.

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:25.740
That's the boss, isn't it?

00:19:25.740 --> 00:19:26.890
Pick it up!

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:28.840
I already said that I won't!

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:30.620
Fine, then I'll pick it up!

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:32.490
That you, Boss?

00:19:32.490 --> 00:19:34.250
<i>Oh, my. Is that you, Hy-chan?</i>

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:37.720
Your sister can't do any housework!

00:19:37.720 --> 00:19:39.680
What kind of education are you giving her?!

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:43.720
That must mean she's over at your place.

00:19:43.720 --> 00:19:44.960
That's good.

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:46.960
No, it's actually not good at all!

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:49.850
I got worried when she didn't come home.

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:52.580
I'm so sorry for all this.

00:19:52.930 --> 00:19:55.020
<i>Could you put her on, please?</i>

00:19:55.020 --> 00:19:55.820
Sure.

00:19:57.050 --> 00:19:58.170
No. I don't want to.

00:19:59.600 --> 00:20:01.670
<i>Ryou-chan, I was so worried!</i>

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:01.670
Sis

00:20:02.070 --> 00:20:04.940
<i>I want to apologize to you, 
so please come home, okay?</i>

00:20:04.940 --> 00:20:07.520
There. You heard her, so talk to her!

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:12.200
What more do you want?

00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:17.070
How can you be so spoiled?!

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:21.190
You have a home to go back to!

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:25.170
Someone who's waiting for you!

00:20:25.170 --> 00:20:26.870
J-Ja-ko....

00:20:27.320 --> 00:20:29.700
If you lose that, it'll all be too late!

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:39.750
You're right.

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:44.340
Hello? Sis?

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:49.300
Yeah. Yeah.

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:51.140
Got it.

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:53.900
I'm going home.

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:57.050
Took you long enough.

00:20:57.840 --> 00:20:59.760
Don't get into fights anymore.

00:21:00.300 --> 00:21:01.190
Yeah.

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:09.110
Thank you.

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:16.930
What'd you even fight about, anyway?

00:21:18.530 --> 00:21:22.170
She wore some clothes I 
really like without asking.

00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:26.650
<i>Cute kitty!</i>

00:21:27.570 --> 00:21:33.190
And once she wears something, 
the chest gets all stretched out!

00:21:33.190 --> 00:21:34.640
<i>Meow...</i>

00:21:35.550 --> 00:21:36.600
Go home.

00:21:38.070 --> 00:21:41.420
Sheesh, I'm finally free.

00:21:43.690 --> 00:21:46.920
Even though she's a mess, 
I guess it's a little lonely without her.

00:21:48.050 --> 00:21:53.700
But more importantly, I need to gather the 
mana crystals and restore the Dark Realm.

00:21:54.610 --> 00:21:58.360
I'm sure the Dark Lord is waiting.

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:38.930
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:38.930
<b>Kokoro Will Not Betray?</b>
